{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGAlQSavnGuzXX7rF2yR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a full build of 11 frames from scratch. I have enough info to build. I use the plugin API and instances of media components, since cross-page instances work in the same file. I don't need more inspection. I check the workspace page state and the base component look, then start building.\n\nDesign system: brand primary #BFB7FD (lavender). Type: Plus Jakarta Sans. Ink #151521. Neutrals: #F7F7FB bg, #FFFFFF surface, #6B6B7B secondary text, #A0A0A0 muted, borders #ECECF3. Success #22B07D, error #E5484D. Chart accents: Sales #BFB7FD, Investment #7C6CF3, Other #E7E3FE.\n\nI build section by section. Section 1: page setup, styles/tokens (paint styles optional), base components: Button variants, TextField variants, Tab bar, Header, Avatar, BalanceCard, ChartBar. I build components on the workspace page in a \"Components\" section, then the frames.\n\nGiven the scale, I write JS with helper functions and create everything programmatically, using component instances where reasonable (for example transaction row component, bill card, tabbar, header). I do it in a few big use_figma calls.\n\nI start with the components section and screen 01, 02.\n\nCoordinates: screens at y=0 row, x spaced 375+64. Frames: 01 x=0, 02 x=439, 03 x=878, 04 x=1317, 05 x=1756, 06 x=2195, 07 x=2634, 08 x=3073, 09 x=3512, 10 x=3951, 11 x=4390. Frame size 375x812.\n\nThe components section sits below at y=1000. Creating instances from components on another page works via figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance().\n\nComponent library: Button/Primary, Button/Secondary, Button/Disabled, Button/Destructive; TextField variants; Header (back + title + avatar/more); TabBar in 4 active variants; Avatar (48) as an instance of Avatar_Neutral; TransactionRow with logo as a nested instance I swap per screen via swapComponent; BillCard; SectionHeader; ChartBar; Keypad. That covers it.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6186,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":29885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6186}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"0652ce84-08a4-4423-91de-801700fe85f9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:27:25.116Z","thinking_duration_ms":35933}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGAlQSavnGuzXX7rF2yR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have everything needed: 11 frames, exact data, brand `#BFB7FD`, Plus Jakarta Sans, and 40 media components I can instance across pages. Building the design system components first on the empty workspace page."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6186,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":29885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6186}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"0dd657ff-35dd-4cae-a6bd-429b4f6495e0","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:27:26.002Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGAlQSavnGuzXX7rF2yR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gki4rj5nEmgMRVaicB35c3","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"// ---------- setup ----------\nconst ws = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.startsWith('03'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style:'Regular'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style:'Medium'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style:'SemiBold'});\ntry { await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style:'Bold'}); } catch(e){}\n\nconst C = {\n  ink:'#151521', ink2:'#5E5E70', muted:'#9A9AA8', line:'#EDECF4',\n  bg:'#F6F5FB', white:'#FFFFFF', primary:'#BFB7FD', deep:'#6F5CF0',\n  deepSoft:'#EFECFE', success:'#1FA97C', error:'#E0483D', warn:'#E5A33C',\n  chip:'#F1EFFA'\n};\nconst rgb = h => ({r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255, g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255, b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255});\nconst solid = (h,o) => ({type:'SOLID', color:rgb(h), opacity:o===undefined?1:o});\n\nfunction frame(parent,name,x,y,w,h,fill,radius){\n  const f = figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; parent.appendChild(f);\n  f.x=x; f.y=y; f.resize(w,h); f.fills = fill? [solid(fill)] : [];\n  if(radius) f.cornerRadius=radius; f.clipsContent = radius?true:false;\n  return f;\n}\nfunction txt(parent,chars,x,y,opts={}){\n  const t = figma.createText(); parent.appendChild(t);\n  t.fontName = {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style: opts.weight||'Regular'};\n  t.characters = chars;\n  t.fontSize = opts.size||14;\n  t.fills = [solid(opts.color||C.ink)];\n  if(opts.lineHeight) t.lineHeight = {value:opts.lineHeight, unit:'PIXELS'};\n  if(opts.spacing) t.letterSpacing = {value:opts.spacing, unit:'PIXELS'};\n  t.textAlignHorizontal = opts.align||'LEFT';\n  t.x=x; t.y=y;\n  if(opts.w) { t.resize(opts.w, t.height); t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; }\n  return t;\n}\nfunction circle(parent,x,y,d,fill){\n  const e = figma.createEllipse(); parent.appendChild(e); e.x=x; e.y=y;\n  e.resize(d,d); e.fills=[solid(fill)]; return e;\n}\nfunction inst(parent, compId, x, y, size){\n  const c = figma.getNodeById(compId);\n  const i = c.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i);\n  if(size){ const s = size/Math.max(i.width,i.height); i.rescale(s); }\n  i.x=x; i.y=y; return i;\n}\nfunction section(name,x,y,w,h){\n  const s = figma.createSection(); ws.appendChild(s);\n  s.name=name; s.x=x; s.y=y; s.resizeWithoutConstraints(w,h);\n  return s;\n}\nconst ds = section('Design System · components', 0, 1050, 3600, 900);\nconst label = (s,x,y)=>txt(ds,s,x,y,{size:12,weight:'SemiBold',color:C.muted,spacing:0.6});\n\n// ---------- Text styles ----------\nconst TS = [\n  ['Display/34', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'},34,41],\n  ['Title/24', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'},24,31],\n  ['Heading/20', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'},20,26],\n  ['Subhead/16 Semibold', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'},16,22],\n  ['Body/14', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'},14,21],\n  ['Body/14 Medium', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'},14,21],\n  ['Label/12', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'},12,17],\n  ['Caption/11', {family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'},11,15],\n];\nfor (const [n,f,s,lh] of TS){\n  const st = figma.createTextStyle(); st.name=n; st.fontName=f; st.fontSize=s; st.lineHeight={value:lh,unit:'PIXELS'};\n}\n\n// ---------- Buttons ----------\nconst btnPrimary = figma.getNodeById('3:52');\n// Secondary\nconst bs = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(bs); bs.name='Button / Secondary';\nbs.resize(335,52); bs.cornerRadius=16; bs.fills=[solid(C.deepSoft)];\nbs.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; bs.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; bs.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nbs.paddingLeft=16; bs.paddingRight=16;\nconst bst = txt(bs,'Continue',0,0,{size:16,weight:'SemiBold',color:C.deep});\n// Disabled\nconst bd = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(bd); bd.name='Button / Disabled';\nbd.resize(335,52); bd.cornerRadius=16; bd.fills=[solid('#E7E6EF')];\nbd.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; bd.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; bd.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\ntxt(bd,'Continue',0,0,{size:16,weight:'SemiBold',color:'#A8A7B6'});\n// Destructive text button\nconst bdel = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(bdel); bdel.name='Button / Destructive';\nbdel.resize(88,34); bdel.cornerRadius=11; bdel.fills=[solid('#FDECEA')];\nbdel.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; bdel.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; bdel.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\ntxt(bdel,'Delete',0,0,{size:13,weight:'SemiBold',color:C.error});\n\nbs.x=0; bs.y=40; bd.x=0; bd.y=112; bdel.x=0; bdel.y=184;\nlabel('Buttons · primary (02) / secondary / disabled / destructive',0,12);\n\n// ---------- Icon button ----------\nconst ib = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(ib); ib.name='Icon Button / 44';\nib.resize(44,44); ib.cornerRadius=22; ib.fills=[solid(C.white)];\nib.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; ib.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; ib.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nib.strokes=[{...solid(C.line)}]; ib.strokeWeight=1;\ninst(ib,'2:8',0,0,20);\nib.x=380; ib.y=40;\nlabel('Icon button 44', 380, 12);\n\n// ---------- Avatar ----------\nfunction avatarComp(name, size, x, y){\n  const a = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(a); a.name=name;\n  a.resize(size,size); a.cornerRadius=size/2; a.fills=[solid('#E9E7F3')];\n  a.clipsContent=true;\n  const inner = inst(a,'2:65',0,0,size*0.92);\n  inner.x=(size-inner.width)/2; inner.y=(size-inner.height)/2;\n  a.x=x; a.y=y; return a;\n}\nconst av48 = avatarComp('Avatar / 48',48,380,120);\nconst av40 = avatarComp('Avatar / 40',40,440,120);\nconst av32 = avatarComp('Avatar / 32',32,500,120);\nlabel('Avatars (Avatar_Neutral)', 380, 92);\n\n// ---------- Tab bar ----------\nfunction tabBar(name, active, x){\n  const b = figma.createComponent(); ds.appendChild(b); b.name=name;\n  b.resize(375,88); b.fills=[solid(C.white)];\n  b.strokes=[{...solid(C.line)}]; b.strokeWeight=1; b.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\n  // use only top border: draw line\n  b.strokes=[]; \n  const ln = figma.createRectangle(); b.appendChild(ln); ln.name='top border'; ln.x=0; ln.y=0; ln.resize(375,1); ln.fills=[solid(C.line)];\n  const tabs = [['Home','2:2',18.75],['Analytics','2:3',112.5],['Cards','2:4',206.25],['Profile','2:5',300]];\n  tabs.forEach(([t,ic,cx],i)=>{\n    const on = i===active;\n    const col = on? C.ink : '#A9A8B8';\n    const item = frame(b,'tab '+t, cx,10,56,50,null);\n    const icon = inst(item, ic, 0, 0, 24);\n    icon.x=(56-24)/2; icon.y=0;\n    if(on){\n      const pill = figma.createRectangle(); item.appendChild(pill); pill.name='active pill';\n      pill.x=(56-24)/2-6; pill.y=-6; pill.resize(36,36); pill.cornerRadius=12;\n      pill.fills=[solid(C.primary,0.55)]; item.insertChild(0,pill);\n    }\n    // recolor icon\n    try { icon.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR'||n.type==='BOOLEAN_OPERATION'||n.type==='FRAME').forEach(n=>{ if('fills' in n && n.fills && n.fills.length) n.fills=[solid(col)]; }); } catch(e){}\n    txt(item,t,0,32,{size:10,weight:on?'SemiBold':'Medium',color:col,w:56,align:'CENTER'});\n  });\n  b.x=x; b.y=40;\n  return b;\n}\ntabBar('Tab Bar / Home',0,600);\ntabBar('Tab Bar / Analytics',1,1000);\ntabBar('Tab Bar / Cards',2,1400);\ntabBar('Tab Bar / Profile',3,1800);\nlabel('Main navigation · 4 tabs, active state', 600, 12);\nreturn 'section 1 ok';","description":"Create workspace design system section: text styles, buttons, icon button, avatars, tab bar variants","fileKey":"JdUlxW8keR6mprUHy9Kv6J"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6186,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":29885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6186}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"632ddf13-6434-4248-9b50-a8fde843a0a7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:27:49.646Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Gki4rj5nEmgMRVaicB35c3","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
