{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGBpmudDwJfR2fCHPWXH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to fix the card screen: \"Transactions\" at y=548 overlaps the Ethereum row, which ends at 512+46=558. I move the heading to 558 and the list to 582, with rows of 44 ending at 714. The \"Primary\" label at 20,20 sits behind the art, so I bring it to the front in white.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":123208,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1182}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"c483cd5a-626c-487a-b96c-5390d8b4e4c3","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:40:27.568Z","thinking_duration_ms":9177}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGBpmudDwJfR2fCHPWXH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately: the reflow introduced a new problem of my own making. The \"Transactions\" heading now sits inside the Ethereum asset row, and the \"Primary\" label is buried behind the card artwork. Both are edits to 07_Cards and neither depends on the other, so they go together in one call; the verification screenshot has to wait for their result."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":123208,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1182}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"085abeee-cf16-47e6-ba77-8c5ed82b0150","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:40:29.527Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGBpmudDwJfR2fCHPWXH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_010CtkFSdz0ttRIqZ8C9q8zp","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.startsWith('03'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold'])await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:s});\nconst C={ink:'#151521',muted:'#9A9AA8',deep:'#6F5CF0',white:'#FFFFFF'};\nconst rgb=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255});\nconst solid=(h,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o});\nconst s7=ws.children.find(c=>c.name==='07_Cards');\n\n// 1) asset rows: 42px rhythm so Ethereum clears the Transactions heading\n['asset Solana','asset Bitcoin','asset Ethereum'].forEach((n,i)=>{\n  const r=s7.children.find(c=>c.name===n);\n  if(r){ r.y=420+i*42; r.resize(335,42); }\n});\n// 2) Transactions heading + list lower\nfor(const t of s7.children.filter(c=>c.type==='TEXT')){\n  if(t.characters==='Transactions') t.y=548;\n  if(t.characters==='See all') t.y=550;\n}\nconst list=s7.children.find(c=>c.name==='transactions');\nif(list){\n  list.y=574;\n  list.children.forEach((r,i)=>{\n    r.y=i*44; r.resize(335,44);\n    const ln=r.children.find(c=>c.type==='RECTANGLE'); if(ln) ln.y=0;\n    // recentre row content for 44px height\n    for(const ch of r.children){\n      if(ch.type==='FRAME'&&ch.name==='logo'){ ch.y=4; }\n      if(ch.type==='TEXT'){\n        const isAmt=ch.characters.startsWith('$')||ch.characters.startsWith('-')||ch.characters.startsWith('+');\n        ch.y=isAmt?11:(ch.fontSize>10?7:25);\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  list.resize(335,132);\n}\n// 3) Primary label in front of the artwork\nconst card=s7.children.find(c=>c.name==='card primary');\nconst prim=card.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'&&c.characters==='Primary');\nif(prim){\n  card.appendChild(prim);\n  prim.y=20; prim.x=20;\n  prim.fills=[solid(C.white)];\n  const pill=figma.createRectangle(); card.appendChild(pill);\n  pill.name='primary pill'; pill.x=14; pill.y=14; pill.resize(70,24); pill.cornerRadius=12;\n  pill.fills=[solid('#0B2F28',0.45)];\n  card.insertChild(card.children.indexOf(prim),pill);\n}\nconst report={};\nfor(const c of s7.children){\n  if((c.type==='TEXT'||c.type==='FRAME')&&!String(c.name).startsWith('hit · ')){\n    const bottom=c.y+c.height;\n    if(bottom>724&&c.y<730) report[c.name]=Math.round(bottom);\n  }\n}\nreturn {overlapsInto:report};","description":"Fix Cards spacing so Transactions heading clears asset rows, and lift Primary label above artwork","fileKey":"JdUlxW8keR6mprUHy9Kv6J"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":123208,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1182}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61aa1638-029c-43a0-97ea-2af852f8e61e","uuid":"7ac494e0-8dfd-4d7c-b0f4-bcbd01d9ec46","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:40:37.080Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_010CtkFSdz0ttRIqZ8C9q8zp","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
